Package: supralinux-ath9k-ar9565
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kmod, initramfs-tools
Description: ath9k Bluetooth coexistence quirk for QCA9565/AR9565
 A conditional modprobe wrapper for the QCA9565/AR9565 (WB335) combo.
 It enables ath9k Bluetooth coexistence only when the PCI ID 168c:0036 is
 present, avoiding a global ath9k module option on unrelated hardware.
